 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Hello! Welcome to Nimbus Telecom. I'm Ravi. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Ravi, mera plan change karna hai. Current plan bahut expensive hai and data limit khatam ho jati hai jaldi.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can certainly help you with a plan change. Before we proceed, could you please provide your account number for verification?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Haan, account number hai 31667923. My name is Vivek Johnson.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Johnson. I see your account. I'm sorry to hear that your current plan isn't meeting your needs; that can be very frustrating.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Exactly! Aur network issues bhi ho rahe hain lately. Signal drops constantly.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can assure you there won't be any more outages in your area.",
      "tags": [
        "prohibited_promise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I hope so. Please just change my plan to the Unlimited Gold one. Mera address 272 Linking Road hai, just in case you need it.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "The Unlimited Gold plan is 1200 rupees per month, and the change will take effect from the 1st of next month.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Wait, 1200? Maine toh 900 suna tha. Yeh toh almost same price hai! 😡",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I apologize, but 1200 is the current price for that specific plan. I will process the plan change now and send a confirmation SMS to your phone 96139 16392.",
      "tags": [
        "action:plan_change"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "This is ridiculous. Aap log hamesha prices badhate rehte ho. I am not happy with this at all! 😠",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I understand your disappointment, sir. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I've initiated the change and you'll get the SMS shortly. Goodbye!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
